  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a shaker with ice, combine key lime juice, Clamato, Worcestershire sauce and habanero pepper sauce; shake well to chill. Serve in a rimmed tall glass with ice; fill with beer. Garnish with lime wheel.",
